<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Daily, weekly, monthly, yearly,</l><l>Christ our milk and Christ our honey,</l><l>Sabbath, new moon and new feasts!</l><l>Eat Him! Eat Him! Eat more of Him!</l><l>Drink Him! Drink Him! Overflow Him!</l><l>Breathe Him! Be His life increase!</l><l>Christ is our good land,</l><l>A rich and vast land;</l><l>We lack for nothing in Him!</l><l>Now walk more in Him,</l><l>Absorb more of Him,</l><l>Filled more and more to the brim!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
